  "description": "A firmware-agnostic emulation of the Infineon CYW43439 Wi-Fi chip as wired on the Raspberry Pi\n      Pico 2 W: the gSPI bus (bit-banged through PIO), the SDIO backplane and firmware download, and\n      the WHD/SDPCM control + Ethernet data plane. The radio link is virtualized behind the chip's\n      register/protocol boundary, so unmodified firmware (pico-sdk, MicroPython, CircuitPython) runs\n      in STA and SoftAP modes against a virtual access point.",
